-                    "SM80, five greedy drafts, PP6/TP1/DP1/PCP1/DCP1, CUDA graphs "
+                    "SM80, five greedy drafts, PP6 (V4.1) or PP3 (V4), TP1/DP1/PCP1/DCP1, "
+                    "CUDA graphs "
                     "and no LoRA/DBO")
